      "url": "https://openasr.org/models/whisper-medium/",
      "snippet": "Medium delivers much of the large model&#x27;s accuracy at a smaller footprint, a strong choice when quality matters but the largest checkpoint is too heavy. This OpenASR repo repackages the original openai/whisper-medium weights as .oasr packs that run natively in the OpenASR runtime with no Python at inference time."
